<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Carulla net profits soar.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Carulla net profits soar.</headline>
<text>
<p>BOGOTA,  April 29 Reuters - The net profits of Colombian supermarket chain Carulla climbed 39 percent in the first quarter of this year compared to the first three months of 1996, the company said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Net profits at the end of March stood at 1.77 billion pesos compared to 1.27 billion in the same period last year.</p>
<p>(--Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944)</p>
</text>
